B.a00=new A.ae("Is GivTask free to use for volunteers?","Yes! Volunteers can join GivTask, browse opportunities, apply for tasks, and receive certificates completely free. There are no hidden fees.")
B.a07=new A.ae("How does GivTask verify NGOs?","NGOs go through a verification process where they submit registration documents, tax-exempt status, and organisation details. Our team reviews and approves each NGO before they can post tasks.")
B.a0c=new A.ae("How are freelancers paid?","Freelancers are paid through our secure milestone payment system. When an NGO approves a milestone deliverable, the payment is automatically released to the freelancer's wallet for withdrawal.")
B.a0a=new A.ae("Can I switch between being a volunteer and a freelancer?","Yes! You can apply to both volunteer tasks (unpaid) and freelance projects (paid) on GivTask. Your profile clearly indicates your skills and preferences.")
B.a09=new A.ae("What types of tasks can NGOs post?","NGOs can post any skill-based task: website development, graphic design, data analysis, content writing, social media management, video production, legal support, accounting, and more.")
B.a0o=new A.ae("How does the AI matching work?","Our AI analyses the skills required for a task, then cross-references them with verified user profiles, past work, quiz scores, and ratings to suggest the best-matched candidates.")
B.a0k=new A.ae("Are digital certificates recognised?","GivTask certificates include a QR verification code and can be shared on LinkedIn, CVs, and portfolios. They are recognised by partner universities and corporate volunteer programs.")
B.a02=new A.ae("What happens if there is a dispute?","Our platform has a structured dispute resolution process. Both parties can submit evidence, and our moderation team will review and resolve the dispute within 5 business days.")
